  /// The holiday type. Always present. Acceptable values are: - "`Christmas`" - "`Easter`" - "`Father's Day`" - "`Halloween`" - "`Independence Day (USA)`" - "`Mother's Day`" - "`Thanksgiving`" - "`Valentine's Day`"
